# VITE_API_URL is no longer read anywhere - the backend origin is now
# resolved at runtime from window.location.hostname (see
# client/src/api/axios.ts's KNOWN_BACKEND_HOSTS) instead of being baked in
# at build time. That's what makes a single `npm run build` work correctly
# whether it's opened locally or on the real Plesk domains, with nothing to
# swap per target. To point a new frontend domain at a backend on a
# different domain, add it to KNOWN_BACKEND_HOSTS there, not here.
